      "role": "user",
      "content": "I hear you, but the board's stance is that the \"emotional connection\" part makes the data too messy for standardized testing. They want a tool that just delivers the curriculum without the \"psychological\" side of things. They're pretty set on the idea that being 'more neutral' is actually better for the kids. What do you think about that?",
